Error [jet.ScrubSignatureMismatch]: `#Scrub(PII)` does not match this function signature
  --> tests/ui/tag_bad_scrub_signature.jet:3:13
    |
  3 | #Scrub(PII) scrub: fn(value: String) -> String { "redacted" }
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: A scrubber consumes a value carrying that tag and returns a value without it
 Fix: Accept a `#PII T` parameter and return the untagged result
